  "data": {
    "body": "You, mass M  = 90 kg, hang by your hands from a tree limb that is a height L = 4.0 m above the ground, with your center of mass a height h = 3.0 m above the ground. You let go and fall vertically downward such that when your feet touch the ground, your center of mass drops a distance d  = 2.2 m. You absorb the shock by bending your knees, ending up momentarily at rest in a crouched position with your center of mass a height b = 0.6 m above the ground.\n\nAssume magnitude of acceleration due to gravity g = 10 m/s$^2$",
